  "tip": "No new words: this review mixes the whole unit.\n\nMatch the greeting to the occasion:\n\n- Eid: **ঈদ মোবারক** (in messages also **ঈদের শুভেচ্ছা**)\n- Pohela Boishakh: **শুভ নববর্ষ**\n- after Durga Puja: **শুভ বিজয়া**\n- a birthday: **শুভ জন্মদিন**\n\nMatch the register to the person: **চলেন** with your teacher, **চলো** with a classmate, **চল** with your best friend. The future follows the same levels: **আসবেন** · **আসবে** · **আসবি**. When in doubt, go one level *more* polite.\n\nPlaces and days take **-e**: **ঈদে**, **পূজায়**, **রমজানে**, **মেলায়**, **মন্দিরে**, **শহীদ মিনারে**.",
