      "title": "A birthday",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "দোস্ত, আজ আমার জন্মদিন। তুই কি আসবি?",
          "tr": "dost, aj amar jonmodin. tui ki ashbi?",
          "en": "Buddy, it's my birthday today. Will you come?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "অবশ্যই! তোর জন্য একটা উপহার কিনব।",
          "tr": "oboshshoi! tor jonno ekta upohar kinbo.",
          "en": "Of course! I'll buy a present for you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "আমাদের বাসায় অনেক লোক আসবে।",
          "tr": "amader bashay onek lok ashbe.",
          "en": "Lots of people will come to our home."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "পিঠা হবে?",
          "tr": "pitha hobe?",
          "en": "Will there be pitha?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Nadia",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, পিঠা আর মিষ্টি হবে।",
          "tr": "hya~, pitha ar mishti hobe.",
          "en": "Yes, there will be pitha and sweets."
        }
      ],
      "question": "Why is Nadia inviting Rafi?",
      "options": [
        "It's Eid",
        "It's Pohela Boishakh",
        "It's her birthday"
      ],
      "answer": 2
